{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.poster.avif?t=1773410143\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.webm?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.mp4?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A roguelike action tale born of dark fairytales and smoldering ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the night the witch set the world ablaze, the ancient order fell with it.<br>Kingdoms crumbled into charred wasteland, and only drifting ash remained to whisper among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across a land where embers entwine with shadow, a small few still resist the spreading corruption \u2014 souls capable of swallowing the remnants of black magic without surrendering their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this perilous power stirring within you, you will carve through the wreckage, grow amidst desolation,<br>and draw ever closer to the truth buried beneath the world\u2019s end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9b5e0ed03f1ff6716fc83085da3c15c9.webp?t=1773410143\" width=421 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short blades cut the dark, cannons tear the corrupted apart, frost brings death itself to stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventurer bears a different fate and fights with a style that belongs to no one else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.poster.avif?t=1773410143\" width=620 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.webm?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.mp4?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/afe8452fb1cd1e3e3eb87215f65133eb.webp?t=1773410143\" width=415 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The embers of black magic corrupt all they touch, yet she never foresaw that <strong>you</strong> would seize this power and bend it into a weapon of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fusions of embers and spellcards reshape your skills and your rhythm, recasting every run into a new and unrepeatable path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.poster.avif?t=1773410143\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.webm?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.mp4?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/4f327791fa4f3260780091f4d2625721.webp?t=1773410143\" width=397 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, recover, and rise again. In the broken corners of this world, a warm flame still waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling, bleeding, failing \u2014 all of it is simply part of the road you walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/09655d39c9a2edebddacd0920028130a.poster.avif?t=1773410143\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/09655d39c9a2edebddacd0920028130a.webm?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/09655d39c9a2edebddacd0920028130a.mp4?t=1773410143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/568ce1004ae7af33a14c8d65f49a4d51.webp?t=1773410143\" width=426 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters, each with a unique pool of 180+ skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130+ pieces of equipment with countless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of random events and room types shaping a new route every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous updates, ever expanding the world and the ways you can master it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/